	<section_number>64.2-1219</section_number>
	<catch_line>Fees of commissioners of accounts</catch_line>
	<text>
		Except as otherwise provided, the circuit court appointing a commissioner of accounts shall prescribe the fees of such commissioner of accounts.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 5414; 1938, p. 141; Code 1950, § 26-24; 1997, cc. 214, 842; 2012, c. 614.</history>
